---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="404 · Ruta no encontrada | César Adrián Morado"
  description="La página que buscas no existe en el portafolio de César Adrián Morado."
  bootLoader={false}
>
  <main class="relative z-10 min-h-[75vh] flex items-center justify-center px-4 pt-28 pb-16 font-mono">
    <div class="max-w-xl w-full bg-slate-950 border-2 border-slate-800 rounded-md overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
      <div class="bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2.5 flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-800">
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-500/80"></span>
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/80"></span>
        <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500/80"></span>
        <span class="ml-2 text-xs text-slate-500">404.sh</span>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 text-center">
        <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.25em] text-purple-400 uppercase mb-3" data-i18n="notfound.kicker">
          // ERROR_DE_RUTA
        </p>
        <h1 class="font-pixel text-7xl sm:text-8xl text-white leading-none mb-2">
          4<span class="text-purple-500">0</span>4
        </h1>
        <h2 class="font-pixel text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-slate-200 mb-4" data-i18n="notfound.title">
          Ruta no encontrada
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-pretty mb-8" data-i18n="notfound.desc">
          El recurso que buscas no existe o fue movido. Puedes volver al inicio, explorar mis proyectos o abrir la paleta de comandos.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 font-pixel text-base">
          <a
            href="/"
            class="px-5 py-2.5 bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-500 text-white transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(168,85,247,0.45)]"
            data-i18n="notfound.home"
          >
            [ VOLVER_AL_INICIO ]
          </a>
          <a
            href="/#projects"
            class="px-5 py-2.5 border border-purple-500/60 text-purple-300 hover:bg-purple-500/10 hover:border-purple-400 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5"
            data-i18n="notfound.projects"
          >
            [ VER_PROYECTOS ]
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
